Package: readmit30
Title: 30-Day All-Cause Readmission Logic on Inpatient Claims
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sanika", "Kalvikatte", email = "sanikakalvikatte1996@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds acute inpatient stays from raw facility claims (claim
    versioning, direct-transfer chaining), selects eligible index discharges,
    and flags unplanned 30-day readmissions using data.table non-equi joins.
    Synthetic data only.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: data.table (>= 1.14)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
